WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.999 line:0
Blackjack: players deal in turn, four hands in all.
Beat the dealer’s total without going over 21.

00:00:06.999 --> 00:00:11.899 line:0
North picks the 100 chip and clicks Bet.

00:00:11.899 --> 00:00:14.999 line:0
North gets two eights;
dealer East shows a 6.

00:00:14.999 --> 00:00:22.998 line:0
Two eights: click Split, stake another 100,
and play two hands with a card added to each.

00:00:22.998 --> 00:00:33.498 line:0
Fast-forward: double, hit, stand. Dealer East draws
to 21: hand one pushes, hand two loses.

00:00:33.498 --> 00:00:36.998 line:0
North deals hand two. East bets 100
and stands on 16.

00:00:36.998 --> 00:00:44.998 line:0
North deals with 14 and must click Hit
below 17.

00:00:44.998 --> 00:00:47.998 line:0
At 17 the dealer may stand,
and beats East’s 16.

00:00:47.998 --> 00:00:53.748 line:0
Fast-forward: hand three. North gets A and K.
An unsplit two-card 21 is blackjack, paid 3:2.

00:00:53.748 --> 00:00:55.998 line:0
Last hand: North deals.
East bets and is dealt 16.

00:00:55.998 --> 00:00:59.498 line:0
Last hand: East has 16 and hits.

00:00:59.498 --> 00:01:06.998 line:0
East draws an 8 for 24 and busts.
A bust loses; dealer North need not draw.

00:01:06.998 --> 00:01:16.000 line:0
Hands done: North 1,250, East 750.
North wins on total chips left after four hands.
